&lt;div class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;f299b106-f5ab-4bce-90c8-cf18e84f4803&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-2-thinking&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web / Front End Developer - Research Participants - United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;26&quot; data-end=&quot;43&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;26&quot; data-end=&quot;43&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;45&quot; data-end=&quot;169&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Remote (UK)&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type of contract:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Freelance&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hourly Rate:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;£19 (pay based on actual study time)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;26&quot; data-end=&quot;43&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;About Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;45&quot; data-end=&quot;169&quot;&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are building the biggest pool of quality human data in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;171&quot; data-end=&quot;344&quot;&gt;Over 35,000 AI developers, researchers, and organizations use Prolific to gather data from paid study participants with a wide variety of experiences, knowledge, and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Do you have a device with a microphone? Get paid to take part in voice interviews. We’re inviting web and front end developers based in the UK to take part in a research study run by an institution focused on global policy change. This is a paid research participation opportunity, not a job as a web or front end developer. Quick signup, flexible schedule, real payouts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your voice can help build a picture of how people across the UK think and talk about important issues, and that evidence is designed to inform real policy decisions. Every participant counts, and together we’re working toward a shared research goal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The project launches in about one week, and places are allocated on a first come, first served basis, so please sign up as soon as you can.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking part in a short voice conversation with another participant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completing a short online survey sharing your views and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Giving honest, considered responses based on your own perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Watching the community research goal progress as more participants take part&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residence in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A device with a working microphone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No research experience or specialist research qualifications required. We want a genuine cross-section of the UK population.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join this project?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This is a chance to be part of something meaningful and have a say in research aimed at shaping policy. Once the findings are published, we’ll share them with participants so you can see the impact of your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that you must be new to Prolific to sign up successfully. If you already have a Prolific account, there is no need to register again. Simply ensure your profile is up to date to be eligible for this and future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;2302&quot; data-end=&quot;2362&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Prolific is a great platform to join as a Participant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2364&quot; data-end=&quot;2679&quot;&gt;Joining our platform as a Prolific participant will give you the chance to influence the AI models of the future using your professional expertise. Once you pass our assessment, you can join Prolific in just 15 minutes, and start enjoying competitive pay rates, flexible hours, and the ability to work from home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2681&quot; data-end=&quot;2975&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioural data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2977&quot; data-end=&quot;3349&quot;&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won&#39;t come solely from scaling existing models, but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviours into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation – one that reflects the breadth and the best of humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;3351&quot; data-end=&quot;3391&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Links to more information on Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;3393&quot; data-end=&quot;3402&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prolific.com/&quot;&gt;Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;3404&quot; data-end=&quot;3413&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@JoinProlific&quot;&gt;Youtube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-start=&quot;3415&quot; data-end=&quot;3435&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Statement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3437&quot; data-end=&quot;3863&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that Prolific may collect your personal data for recruiting and global organisation planning. Prolific&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/Policy-Privacy-Notice-for-Candidates-f94a136a67544388b4888bc436451b57&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;explains what personal information Prolific may process, where Prolific may process your personal information, its purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over Prolific use of your personal personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Codeless, our internal Server-Driven UI (SDUI) platform team. In this role, you will lead a cross-functional team bridging mobile/web frontend engineering and core platform backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this role is deeply rooted in modern UI architecture, its mission goes beyond standard UI development: Codeless empowers product teams across the organization to ship dynamic, native UI experiences dynamically from the backend—eliminating app store release bottlenecks, dramatically accelerating feature iteration, and establishing a unified UI schema across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with broad impact, from hands-on technical guidance to championing web and mobile accessibility across the company. We&#39;re looking for a leader who excels at fostering collaboration and can confidently guide a concept from initial idea to robust implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, mentor, and scale an engineering team responsible for our core Server-Driven UI platform (&quot;Codeless&quot;). Foster an inclusive, high-ownership engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture &amp;amp; Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the design and evolution of dynamic layout engines, declarative UI schemas, and client rendering frameworks across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Velocity &amp;amp; Platform Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product feature teams to drive internal adoption of Codeless. Ensure the platform provides exceptional Developer Experience, clear tooling, robust design system integration, and seamless debugging workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Execution &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Set high technical standards for platform performance, payload optimization, caching strategies, backward compatibility, and graceful offline/fallback behavior across client devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers, Design System leaders, and Core Infrastructure engineers to align the Codeless roadmap with broader company initiatives and global design paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll need to thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Management:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience managing software engineering teams, with a track record of coaching engineers, delivering complex platform initiatives, and driving technical strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI &amp;amp; Platform Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundational background in mobile (iOS/Android) or modern web architecture (React, SwiftUI, Jetpack Compose, or declarative UI paradigms).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Platform Mindset:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to treat internal product engineering teams as customers, evaluating platform success through developer velocity, adoption metrics, and rendering performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
