&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with C# / .NET 8, Azure, SQL Server, React and TypeScript, and help modernise a large .NET Framework codebase. AI tools are part of how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
