&lt;li&gt;Lead large projects from design to rollout with one or two other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernise legacy code, building in automated tests and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, engineering and client support, and join our on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
